<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
      xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
      xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>PFAS Method Profiles</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
           font-size: 14px; background: #f5f5f5; color: #212121; }

    .page-header { background: #1a237e; color: #fff; padding: 14px 24px;
                   display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; }
    .page-header a  { color: #c5cae9; font-size: 12px; text-decoration: none; }
    .page-header a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .page-body { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }

    .lead { color: #546e7a; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; }

    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #fff;
            border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1); overflow: hidden; }
    thead th { background: #eceff1; padding: 10px 14px; text-align: left;
               font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;
               letter-spacing: .04em; color: #455a64; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd; }
    tbody td { padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
               vertical-align: top; font-size: 13px; }
    tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    tbody tr:hover td { background: #f8f9fa; }

    .method-id { font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #1565c0;
                 background: #e3f2fd; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 3px; }
    .badge { font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 10px;
             font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .badge-custom  { background: #e8f5e9; color: #1b5e20; }
    .badge-default { background: #fff9c4; color: #f57f17; }

    .btn-edit { display: inline-block; background: #1565c0; color: #fff;
                padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;
                font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
    .btn-edit:hover { background: #1976d2; }

    .desc { color: #616161; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-header">
  <h1>PFAS Method Profiles</h1>
  <a tal:attributes="href string:${view/portal_url}/@@pfas-control-chart">
    ← Control Charts
  </a>
</div>

<div class="page-body">
  <p class="lead">
    Configure per-method QC acceptance criteria.  Changes are saved immediately
    to the database and exported to the pipeline worker automatically.
    Managers and Lab Managers may edit; bench analysts have read-only access via
    the normal SENAITE views.
  </p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Method ID</th>
        <th>Display Name</th>
        <th>Description</th>
        <th>Status</th>
        <th>Actions</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr tal:repeat="m view/methods">
        <td>
          <span class="method-id" tal:content="m/method_id">FDA_32PFAS</span>
        </td>
        <td tal:content="m/display_name">FDA 32-PFAS in Food</td>
        <td>
          <div class="desc" tal:content="m/description">...</div>
        </td>
        <td>
          <span class="badge badge-custom"
                tal:condition="m/is_customised">Customised</span>
          <span class="badge badge-default"
                tal:condition="not:m/is_customised">Default</span>
        </td>
        <td>
          <a class="btn-edit"
             tal:attributes="href string:@@pfas-method-profile-edit?method_id=${m/method_id}">
            Edit
          </a>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

</body>
</html>
